<title>FINLAND: HUHTAMAKI TRADE RESUMES AT 1605/1305 GMT.</title>
<headline>HUHTAMAKI TRADE RESUMES AT 1605/1305 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Finnish confectionery and packaging group Huhtamaki Oy shares resumed at 1605/1305 GMT, the Helsinki Stock Exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Trade was suspended ahead of Huhtamaki's announcement at 1600 that it was swapping confectionery units with U.S. group Hershey .</p>
<p>At 1605, Huhtamaki jumped to trade 10.00 markka higher at 195.00. It stood at 182.00, down 3.00, before the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 242</p>
</text>
